{
  "file": "Guidance for national",
  "page": 120,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "bbox": [
        231.10589599609375,
        21.884788513183594,
        277.722412109375,
        32.93328857421875
      ],
      "text": "Guidance for",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-LightCn",
      "size": 9.5,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        277.722412109375,
        21.884788513183594,
        349.1717834472656,
        32.93328857421875
      ],
      "text": "national tuberculosis",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-LightCn",
      "size": 9.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        351.4517822265625,
        21.884788513183594,
        407.7772216796875,
        32.93328857421875
      ],
      "text": "programmes on",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-LightCn",
      "size": 9.5,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        407.7772216796875,
        21.884788513183594,
        518.984130859375,
        32.93328857421875
      ],
      "text": "the management of tuberculosis",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-LightCn",
      "size": 9.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        518.984130859375,
        21.884788513183594,
        557.1551513671875,
        32.93328857421875
      ],
      "text": "in children",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-LightCn",
      "size": 9.5,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        104.88189697265625,
        83.1881103515625,
        513.4655151367188,
        96.53961181640625
      ],
      "text": "not received BCG in the first few weeks of life, since clinical manifestations of HIV",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        104.88189697265625,
        99.18463134765625,
        513.4425659179688,
        112.5361328125
      ],
      "text": "infection typically occur after 3 months of age. If infection status can be established",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        104.88189697265625,
        115.18115234375,
        513.3965454101562,
        128.53265380859375
      ],
      "text": "with early virological testing, BCG may then be administered once HIV infection has",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        104.88189697265625,
        131.17767333984375,
        183.4958953857422,
        144.5291748046875
      ],
      "text": "been ruled out.",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        153.1881103515625,
        513.4375610351562,
        166.53961181640625
      ],
      "text": "The Panel noted that these recommendations were reconsidered in 2010 with new",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        169.18463134765625,
        513.4491577148438,
        182.5361328125
      ],
      "text": "data, and it was concluded that the new data did not provide arguments for modifying",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        185.18115234375,
        513.4374389648438,
        198.53265380859375
      ],
      "text": "the current policy as stated in: Global Advisory Committee on Vaccine Safety, 3–4",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        201.10867309570312,
        513.4030151367188,
        214.5291748046875
      ],
      "text": "Weekly Epidemiological  December 2009. Use of BCG vaccine in HIV-infected infants.",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-LightItali",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        217.10519409179688,
        205.85838317871094,
        230.52569580078125
      ],
      "text": "Record , 2010, 85:32-33.",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-LightItali",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        241.68072509765625,
        513.426025390625,
        255.0322265625
      ],
      "text": "The Panel noted that the application of the recommendation depends on many",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        257.67724609375,
        513.4605102539062,
        271.02874755859375
      ],
      "text": "circumstances that vary between settings and that this was acknowledged and",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        273.67376708984375,
        513.4375610351562,
        287.0252685546875
      ],
      "text": "addressed in some detail in: Revised BCG vaccination guidelines for infants at risk for HIV",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        289.6012878417969,
        513.3915405273438,
        303.02178955078125
      ],
      "text": "Weekly Epidemiological Record infection.  , 2007, 82:193-196. The text of this document",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-LightItali",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        305.66680908203125,
        217.54238891601562,
        319.018310546875
      ],
      "text": "is reproduced in full above.",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        329.8973083496094,
        238.85191345214844,
        343.5248107910156
      ],
      "text": "Summary of recent evidence",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Bold",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        349.01031494140625,
        513.4490356445312,
        362.36181640625
      ],
      "text": "A systematic review that considered all cases of BCG disease reported in the literature",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        365.0068054199219,
        513.3569946289062,
        378.3583068847656
      ],
      "text": "up to 2009 was considered by the Panel. Since publication of the review, there has been",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        381.0032958984375,
        513.4605712890625,
        394.35479736328125
      ],
      "text": "one additional study that reported no cases of BCG disease (regional or disseminated)",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        396.9997863769531,
        513.41455078125,
        410.3512878417969
      ],
      "text": "among HIV-positive and exposed infants; however, the number of participants in this",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        412.99627685546875,
        168.10389709472656,
        426.3477783203125
      ],
      "text": "study was small.",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        437.5027770996094,
        513.483642578125,
        450.8542785644531
      ],
      "text": "Consideration was given to the observed possible variation in risk between settings and",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        453.499267578125,
        236.05735778808594,
        466.85076904296875
      ],
      "text": "between different BCG strains.",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        477.7297668457031,
        198.1304168701172,
        491.3572692871094
      ],
      "text": "Other considerations",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Bold",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        496.8427734375,
        513.4605712890625,
        510.19427490234375
      ],
      "text": "The Panel also noted that the epidemiology has changed since 2006 and continues",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        512.8392944335938,
        513.4373779296875,
        526.1907958984375
      ],
      "text": "to change, so that BCG disease is now less common than it was in 2006. Today,",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        528.8357543945312,
        513.4144897460938,
        542.187255859375
      ],
      "text": "the implementation of more prevention of mother-to-child transmission (PMTCT)",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        544.8322143554688,
        513.3683471679688,
        558.1837158203125
      ],
      "text": "programmes is resulting in fewer infants born with HIV infection; there is also increased",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        560.8287353515625,
        472.75048828125,
        574.1802368164062
      ],
      "text": "access to early ART for HIV-positive infants, which reduces risk of BCG disease.",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        585.3352661132812,
        513.3685302734375,
        598.686767578125
      ],
      "text": "The Panel noted the risk of BCG-IRIS in HIV-positive infants receiving ART, and that the",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        601.3317260742188,
        444.7825012207031,
        614.6832275390625
      ],
      "text": "risk of death is far lower for BCG-IRIS than for disseminated BCG disease.",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        625.8382568359375,
        513.3683471679688,
        639.1897583007812
      ],
      "text": "Finally, the Panel noted that the Global Advisory Committee on Vaccine Safety (GACVS)",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        641.8347778320312,
        510.2173767089844,
        655.186279296875
      ],
      "text": "does not use the GRADE methodology for evaluating the quality of evidence; the BCG-",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        657.8312377929688,
        358.10693359375,
        671.1827392578125
      ],
      "text": "related recommendations were therefore left ungraded.",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        682.061767578125,
        161.72140502929688,
        695.6892700195312
      ],
      "text": "Panel decision",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Bold",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        701.1747436523438,
        513.368408203125,
        714.5262451171875
      ],
      "text": "No change to recommendations or to the application of recommendations, but a change",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        717.1712646484375,
        240.13987731933594,
        730.5227661132812
      ],
      "text": "to the wording was suggested:",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        744.1962280273438,
        213.58639526367188,
        757.82373046875
      ],
      "text": "Recommendation 15 n",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Bold",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        102.88739776611328,
        769.0017700195312,
        510.1714782714844,
        782.6292724609375
      ],
      "text": "In settings where TB is highly endemic or where there is high risk of expo-",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Bold",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        102.88739776611328,
        782.8017578125,
        477.77581787109375,
        796.4292602539062
      ],
      "text": "sure to TB, a single dose of BCG vaccine should be given to all infants",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Bold",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        553.0839233398438,
        805.8439331054688,
        586.4439086914062,
        835.8439331054688
      ],
      "text": "101",
      "font": "HelveticaNeue-Light",
      "size": 20.0,
      "type": "heading_main"
    }
  ]
}